fect certain features and functions.\\nFunctional\\nFunctional\\nAlways active\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s92\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 10581, \"end\": 10895, \"text\": \"The technical storage or access is strictly necessary for the legitimate purpose of enabling the use of a specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of carrying out the transmission of a communication over an electronic communications network.\\nPreferences\\nPreferences\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s93\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 10895, \"end\": 11238, \"text\": \"The technical storage or access is necessary for the legitimate purpose of storing preferences that are not requested by the subscriber or user.\\nStatistics\\nStatistics\\nThe technical storage or access that is used exclusively for statistical purposes.\\nThe technical storage or access that is used exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes. \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s94\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 11238, \"end\": 11483, \"text\": \"Without a subpoena, voluntary compliance on the part of your Internet Service Provider, or additional records from a third party, information stored or retrieved for this purpose alone cannot usually be used to identify you.\\nMarketing\\nMarketing\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s95\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 11483, \"end\": 11875, \"text\": \"The technical storage or access is required to create user profiles to send advertising, or to track the user on a website or across several websites for similar marketing purposes.\\nManage options\\nManage services\\nManage {vendor_count} vendors\\nRead more about these purposes\\nAccept all\\nDeny all\\nView preferences\\nSave preferences\\nView preferences\\n{title}\\n{title}\\n{title}\\nManage consent\\nEnglish\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s96\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 11875, \"end\": 12016, \"text\": \"Deutsch (German)\\nNorsk bokmål (Norwegian Bokmål)\\nRomână (Romanian)\\nHrvatski (Croatian)\\nFrançais (French)\\nNederlands (Dutch)\\nEspañol (Spanish)\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s109\", \"doc_id\": \"web-d2da76dfb75d6b3b36df3b54\", \"start\": 4602, \"end\": 4989, \"text\": \"EHA Research Grants are designed to support the future of hematology by helping talented junior researchers to:\\nConduct basic or translational lab-based research\\nGain valuable research and leadership experience\\nMove towards becoming group leaders\\nAdvance their careers\\nYou’re eligible if:\\nYou’re an EHA member\\nYour institute is an academic research center or proven equivalent in Europe\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s108\", \"doc_id\": \"web-d2da76dfb75d6b3b36df3b54\", \"start\": 4226, \"end\": 4602, \"text\": \"EHA Research Grant review and selection process\\nExtending the reach of EHA Grants\\nWhat an EHA Research Grant covers\\nEHA Bilateral Collaborative Grant\\nEHA Innovation Grant\\nEHA Kick-off Grant\\nEHA Research Mobility Grant\\nEHA Grants Hall of Fame\\nEHA Travel Grants\\nNon-EHA funding opportunities\\nScope of our grants\\nThe call has closed. Winners will be announced by mid-April 2027.\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s110\", \"doc_id\": \"web-d2da76dfb75d6b3b36df3b54\", \"start\": 4989, \"end\": 5372, \"text\": \"You have the s