ch Grant are the:\\nEHA Junior Research Grant, which can provide up to €150,000 for three years\\nEHA Advanced Research Grant, which can provide up to €240,000 for three years\\nEHA Physician Scientist Research Grant, which can provide up to €240,000 for three years\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s112\",\"d3\",5741,6073,\"Each one of the three types of EHA Research Grant also has its own specific eligibility criteria. Please make sure you read the eligibility criteria for your grant type before you apply.\\nTopics-in-Focus Research Grants: If your research focuses on hemoglobinopathies, you will have a competitive advantage in the selection process. \",\"document\",[]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\",\"time_scope\":\"project timeline\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"failed_batch_reviews\":[{\"id\":\"failed_batch_0cb378cd6564484dca7a84a7\",\"variable\":\"start_date\",\"query_identity\":\"9240bd8598d848495f4a72768ddf714ba4de6296ee47f9465694f1c6404f109f\",\"batch_identity\":\"eb1dced05a980bd4c0069129e491c8c99524c839b2c524dddbe2f73bf9fc0ac4\",\"task_id\":\"project_info\",\"phase\":\"history\",\"source_ids\":[\"s92\",\"s96\",\"s85\",\"s95\",\"s86\",\"s46\",\"s59\",\"s109\",\"s44\",\"s93\",\"s91\",\"s108\",\"s58\",\"s88\",\"s45\",\"s94\",\"s87\",\"s89\",\"s110\",\"s90\"],\"failed\":[{\"variable\":\"start_date\",\"id\":\"obs_start_1\",\"feedback\":\"Independent original-source grounding review not_entailed: Source s85 describes the launch of the ASCERTAIN project, not the SUPPLY project involving EHA. No start date for the requested entity is provided.\",\"observation\":{\"id\":\"obs_start_1\",\"stance\":\"irrelevant\",\"value\":null,\"source_ids\":[\"s85\"],\"entity_scope\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\",\"time_scope\":\"project timeline\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"Source s85 describes the launch of the ASCERTAIN project, not the SUPPLY project involving EHA. No evidence 