\\nEHA Advanced Research Grant, which can provide up to €240,000 for three years\\nEHA Physician Scientist Research Grant, which can provide up to €240,000 for three years\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s112\",\"d3\",5741,6073,\"Each one of the three types of EHA Research Grant also has its own specific eligibility criteria. Please make sure you read the eligibility criteria for your grant type before you apply.\\nTopics-in-Focus Research Grants: If your research focuses on hemoglobinopathies, you will have a competitive advantage in the selection process. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s113\",\"d3\",6073,6453,\"Please select the ‘Topics-in-Focus Research Grant’ version of your grant type on your application form.\\nExtending the reach of our grants: If you are operating in a country less-represented among EHA grantees, you will have a competitive advantage in the selection process. ​You can see a full list of these countries on our page about extending the reach of EHA Research Grants.\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s114\",\"d3\",6453,6848,\"If you have questions about your eligibility, you can contact us at [email protected] before submitting an application.\\nHow to apply for an EHA Research Grant\\nWhat an EHA Research Grant covers\\nEHA Research Grant review and selection process\\nShare\\nGrants\\nEHA Research Grants\\nHow to apply for an EHA Research Grant\\nEHA Research Grant review and selection process\\nExtending the reach of EHA Grants\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s97\",\"d3\",0,386,\"EHA Research Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)EHA Research Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\\nEHA Research Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\\nEHA Research Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\\nCongress\\nHemaSphere\\nAbout EHA\\nSearch\\nConnect & Network\\nClinical practice\\nEducation & Training\\nResearch & Innovation\\nJoin EHA\\nLogin\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s98\",\"d3\",386,762,\"EHA2027 Congress\\nEHA2026 Congress\\nCongre