C\\nEDI STATEMENT\\nCONDUCT & SAFETY\\nHISTORY\\nPROCEEDINGS\\nINFLUENTIAL PAPERS\\nORGANIZING ICSE\\nSTEERING COMMITTEE\\nICSE SC Documents\\nSPONSORS\\nCONTACTS\\nLast updat\"}}, {\"id\": \"l4\", \"source_doc_id\": \"web-221ef5a05cae5e8a687cc074\", \"url\": \"http://www.icse-conferences.org/proceedings.html\", \"text\": \"PROCEEDINGS\", \"source_region\": \"content\", \"source_context\": {\"start\": 76, \"end\": 256, \"text\": \"OME\\nNews from the SC\\nEDI STATEMENT\\nCONDUCT & SAFETY\\nHISTORY\\nPROCEEDINGS\\nINFLUENTIAL PAPERS\\nORGANIZING ICSE\\nSTEERING COMMITTEE\\nICSE SC Documents\\nSPONSORS\\nCONTACTS\\nLast updated\\nJan 2\"}}, {\"id\": \"l5\", \"source_doc_id\": \"web-221ef5a05cae5e8a687cc074\", \"url\": \"http://www.icse-conferences.org/mostinfluential.html\", \"text\": \"INFLUENTIAL PAPERS\", \"source_region\": \"content\", \"source_context\": {\"start\": 88, \"end\": 268, \"text\": \"m the SC\\nEDI STATEMENT\\nCONDUCT & SAFETY\\nHISTORY\\nPROCEEDINGS\\nINFLUENTIAL PAPERS\\nORGANIZING ICSE\\nSTEERING COMMITTEE\\nICSE SC Documents\\nSPONSORS\\nCONTACTS\\nLast updated\\nJan 2026\\nNews fro\"}}, {\"id\": \"l6\", \"source_doc_id\": \"web-221ef5a05cae5e8a687cc074\", \"url\": \"http://www.icse-conferences.org/organization.html\", \"text\": \"ORGANIZING ICSE\", \"source_region\": \"content\", \"source_context\": {\"start\": 107, \"end\": 287, \"text\": \"ENT\\nCONDUCT & SAFETY\\nHISTORY\\nPROCEEDINGS\\nINFLUENTIAL PAPERS\\nORGANIZING ICSE\\nSTEERING COMMITTEE\\nICSE SC Documents\\nSPONSORS\\nCONTACTS\\nLast updated\\nJan 2026\\nNews from the SC\\nDec 20, 20\"}}], \"supported_parent_doc_ids\": [], \"source_pages\": [{\"doc_id\": \"web-221ef5a05cae5e8a687cc074\", \"title\": \"ICSE News\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 20, \"end\": 1620, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 1600}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"ICSE\\nInternational Conference\\non Software Engineering®\\nHOME\\nNews from the SC\\nEDI STATEMENT\\nCONDUCT & SAFETY\\nHISTORY\\nPROCEEDINGS\\nINFLUENTIAL PAPERS\\nORGANIZING ICSE\\nSTEERING COMMITTEE\\nICSE SC Documents\\nSPONSORS\\nCONTACTS\\nLast updated\\nJan 2026\\nNews from the SC\\nDec 20, 2025:\\nTokyo Selected to Host ICSE 2029\\nBy ICSE Tokyo Bidding Committee\\nThe ICSE Tokyo Bidding Committee is thrilled and deeply honored that the ICSE Steering\\nCommittee has selected Tokyo as the host city for the 51st International Conference on\\nSoftware Engineering (ICSE 2029).\\nJapan has proudly hosted ICSE twice before - ICSE 1982 in Tokyo and ICSE 1998 in Kyoto. After\\nnearly 30 years, ICSE is finally returning to Japan, and we are delighted to welcome the\\ncommunity back to Tokyo, starting the next 50 years of ICSE. As Japan’s capital, Tokyo is\\nconsistently recognized as one of the safest cities in the world and is among the most\\ndynamic and populous metropolitan areas globally, regularly topping travelers’ rankings.\\nThe Japanese software engineering community, represented by IPSJ-SIGSE together with many\\nother groups - including IEICE SIG-SS, SIG-KBSE, JSSST FOSE, MLSE, and rePiT - has been\\nsteadily growing and strengthening its research and practice activities. These efforts have\\ncreated vibrant, long-standing nationwide networks of researchers, practitioners, and\\neducators, supported by strong and active international collaborations.\\nThe Japanese software engineering community is proud to welcome ICSE 2029 to Tokyo, with the\\ngenerous support of the Tokyo Convention & Visitors Bureau and valued sponsors. Hostin\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-7b855fc9dc0c9e96e2068233\", \"title\": \"Organizing ICSE\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 32, \"end\": 1626, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 1594}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"ICSE\\nInternational Conference\\non Software Engineering®\\nHOME\\nNews from the SC\\nEDI STATEMENT\\nCONDUCT & SAFETY\\nHISTORY\\nPROCEEDINGS\\nINFLUENTIAL PAPERS\\nORGANIZING ICSE\\nSTEERING COMMITTEE\\nICSE SC Documents\\nSPONSORS\\nCONTACTS\\nLast updated\\nJan 2026\\nORGANIZING ICSE\\nFor over forty years, the International Conference on Software\\nEngineering (ICSE) has\\nserved as a premier forum for the presentation and exchange of the latest research results\\nand practical experiences in\\nsoftware engineering theories, methods, techniques, tools, and practices. To ensure the\\ncontinued excellence and success of\\nthe ICSE conference series, the ICSE Steering Committee (SC), ACM Special Interest Group in\\nSoftware Engineering (SIGSOFT),\\nIEEE-CS Technical Council on Software Engineering (TCSE), Association for Computing\\nMachinery, Inc. (ACM), and Institute of\\nElectrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE), incorporated, through its IEEE Computer Society\\n(IEEE-CS) entered into a\\nMemorandum of Understanding (MOU). The purpose of the MOU is to define and clarify the\\nroles, authorities, responsibilities,\\nand key practices of the co-sponsors and the organizers of ICSE. This document also contains\\nICSE Operating Rules and Guidelines\\nthat constitute significant ICSE corporate knowledge to support ICSE continuity.\\nICSE Organizational Guidelines\\nICSE Operating\\nRules and Guidelines 2023 (24 pages pdf document)\\nCall for Letters of Interest to Host ICSE 2030.\\nCall for\\nLetters of Interest to Host ICSE 2030 (1 page pdf document)\\nOther useful documents:\\nICSE Duplicate Submission\\nStatement\\nICSE Awards and Plaques (PDF, PPT)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-cf8967a02467e5aac69cec2e\", \"title\": \"ICSE SC Documents\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 36, \"end\": 1541, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 1505}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"ICSE\\nInternational Conference\\non Software Engineering®\\nHOME\\nNews from the SC\\nEDI STATEMENT\\nCONDUCT & SAFETY\\nHISTORY\\nPROCEEDINGS\\nINFLUENTIAL PAPERS\\nORGANIZING ICSE\\nSTEERING COMMITTEE\\nICSE SC Documents\\nSPONSORS\\nCONTACTS\\nLast updated\\nJan 2026\\nICSE SC Documents\\nThe following documents contain useful information for members of ICSE\\nOrganization and Program Committees. These documents embody significant ICSE corporate\\nknowledge to support ICSE continuity. More corporate ICSE knowledge can be found under Organizing ICSE.\\nICSE 2024 SC Strategic Discussions (PDF)\\nICSE\\n2019 PC Chairs Report by Bultan and Whittle (PDF)\\nICSE\\n2018 PC Chairs Report by Chechik, Harman, Zimmerman and Crnkovic (PDF)\\nICSE 2017 Report on the Technical Track V1.0 by Orso,\\nRobillard and Zimmermann (PDF)\\nICSE PC Chairs Guiding Document 1.1 by Canfora, Chechik,\\nCleland-Huang, van der Hoek, Robillard, Visser and Whittle (PDF)\\nICSE 2016 Insights and Lessons Learned from Analyzing ICSE\\n2016 by Visser and Williams (PDF)\\nICSE 2015 Report on Technical Track by Canfora and Elbaum\\n(PDF)\\nICSE\\n2014 Insights and Lessons Learned from Analyzing ICSE 2014 by Briand and van der Hoek\\n(PDF)\\nICSE 2008\\nWorkshop Report by Engels and Müller (PDF)\\nICSE 2005\\nFinal Report by Gruia-Catalin Roman (PDF)\\nICSE 2001\\nFinal Report by Müller, Harrold and Schäfer (PDF)\\nICSE 2001\\nPostmortem Report slides Müller, Harrold and Schäfer (PDF)\\nICSE 2000\\nFinal Report by Kevin Ryan (PDF)\\nICSE 2000\\nWorkshop Organization by Antonia Bertolino and Gail Murphy (HTML)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-a9996aaca50aaf1f18002e6e\", \"title\": \"ICSE Home Page\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 30, \"end\": 1630, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 1600}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"ICSE\\nInternational Conference\\non Software Engineering®\\nHOME\\nNews from the SC\\nEDI STATEMENT\\nCONDUCT & SAFETY\\nHISTORY\\nPROCEEDINGS\\nINFLUENTIAL PAPERS\\nORGANIZING ICSE\\nSTEERING COMMITTEE\\nICSE SC Documents\\nSPONSORS\\nCONTACTS\\nLast updated\\nJan 2026\\nWELCOME\\nICSE, the International Conference on Software Engineering,® is the premier software\\nengineering conference, providing a forum for researchers, practitioners and educators to\\npresent and discuss the most recent innovations, trends, experiences and concerns in the\\nfield of software engineering. Note that ICSE: International Conference on Software\\nEngineering® is a registered trademark.\\nOn this web site you can find information about the ICSE conference series as well as useful\\ninformation for organizing a future ICSE conference.\\nCURRENT CONFERENCE\\nICSE 2026: Apr 2026\\nRio de Janeiro, Brazil\\nFUTURE CONFERENCES\\nICSE 2027: Apr 2027\\nDublin, Ireland\\nICSE 2028: Apr 2028\\nHawaii, USA\\nICSE 2029: Apr 2029\\nTokyo, Japan\\nPAST CONFERENCES\\nICSE 2025: April 26 - May 4 2025\\nOttawa, Canada\\nICSE 2024: Apr 12-21, 2024\\nLisbon, Portugal\\nICSE 2023: May 14-20, 2023\\nMelbourne, Australia\\nICSE 2022: May 8-27, 2022\\nPittsburgh, USA\\nICSE 2021: May 20-30, 2021\\nMadrid, Spain\\nICSE 2020: July 6-11 2020\\nSeoul, Korea\\nICSE 2019: May 25 - June 1, 2019\\nMontréal, Canada\\nICSE 2018: May 27 - June 3,\\n2018\\nGothenburg, Sweden\\nICSE 2017: May 20-28, 2017\\nBuenos Aires, Argentina\\nICSE 2016: May 14-22, 2016\\nAustin, Texas, USA\\nICSE 2015: May 16-24, 2015\\nFirenze, Italy\\nICSE 2014: May 31 - June 7, 2014\\nHyderabad, India\\nICSE 2013: May 18-26, 2013\\nSan Francisco, USA\\nICSE 2012: June 2-9,\"}], \"local_exploration\": {\"visited_doc_ids\": [\"web-a9996aaca50aaf1f18002e6e\", \"web-cf8967a02467e5aac69cec2e\", \"web-7b855fc9dc0c9e96e2068233\", \"web-221ef5a05cae5e8a687cc074\"], \"visited_pages\": [{\"doc_id\": \"web-a9996aaca50aaf1f18002e6e\", \"url\": \"http://www.icse-conferences.org/\", \"title\": \"ICSE Home Page\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-cf8967a02467e5aac69cec2e\", \"url\": \"http://www.icse-conferences.org/reports.html\", \"title\": \"ICSE SC Documents\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-7b855fc9dc0c9e96e2068233\", \"url\": \"http://icse-conferences.org/organization.html\", \"title\": \"Organizing ICSE\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-221ef5a05cae5e8a687cc074\", \"url\": \"http://www.icse-conferences.org/news.html\", \"title\": \"ICSE News\"}], \"visited_doc_count\": 4, \"omitted_vi